Ring Intercom Talk (ring_sprechanlage)

This integration is based on ring-intercom-video by cmos486
(https://github.com/cmos486/ring-intercom-video), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications: reduced to two-way talk only, added support for the
audio-only Ring Intercom (intercom_handset_audio), session tracking and a
"talk active" binary sensor.
